<title>SINGAPORE: Chuan Hup unit in S$16 mln land tender.</title>
<headline>Chuan Hup unit in S$16 mln land tender.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chuan Hup Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday its wholly-owned unit, Chuan Hup Realty Pte Ltd, together with Heng Holdings SEA (Pte) Ltd, had been awarded a land tender for a joint bid of Singapore $16.05 million.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the tender was for a 99-year lease of a 12,460.8 sq metre site in the west of Singapore for a residential development by the government-run Housing &amp; Development Board.</p>
<p>Chuan Hup Realty holds a 75 percent stake in the venture.</p>
</text>
